{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672100/extras/ae25e87ecc45e4d1dbd1509d9196cae3.avif?t=1763899715\" width=1560 height=306 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Home County\u00a0is a village-management game inspired by Edwardian Britain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a fully functional village! Watch your gardener harvesting flowers, your blacksmith crafting, or your artisan crafting goods. Tend to your villager's needs and keep spirits high. Set up production lines to maximise your village's output.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672100/extras/fb810ff4cf4db0b9b670ff4cb7526dbb.avif?t=1763899715\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672100/extras/3761f2b60f19a0a9987ed0e5ad9db8a5.avif?t=1763899715\" width=1560 height=306 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Specialise your village with 12 unique village goals! Will you turn your village into a cult, an artistic paradise, or a\u00a0 monastery?\u00a0Will you become a Lord/Lady or lead your village as equals? Mix and match any of the goals to create your own unique village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672100/extras/14ecac949aa00deec9f35304f56074b8.poster.avif?t=1763899715\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672100/extras/14ecac949aa00deec9f35304f56074b8.webm?t=1763899715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672100/extras/14ecac949aa00deec9f35304f56074b8.mp4?t=1763899715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672100/extras/20926e5c1a2872cd2b7bc5cd460b473a.avif?t=1763899715\" width=1560 height=306 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your days pursuing charming hobbies like painting, fishing, or mining. You might get dirty along the way, so be sure to take a wash in your tub! Unwind with the radio, or indulge in a restful nap. Fully immerse yourself in the countryside life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672100/extras/e1ffc125bde03054b6e0ca54848058f1.avif?t=1763899715\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672100/extras/89c9215349358b31bc9f6d1ecb3eda85.avif?t=1763899715\" width=1560 height=306 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restore the Crystal Garden, and get to know a cast of 16 characters, each with their own personality, routines, and storylines. Venture into a mines filled with history, treasures, and adventure. Explore a world inspired by  Edwardian Britain. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672100/extras/afc55f9a1d2f7adfd554dfdb785f5cf5.avif?t=1763899715\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Pocket Money","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3672100/5ab1ec093601cf219d1e667512ce607a6092ac4f.jpg"},{"name":"A Few Bob","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3672100/bfcbee448e